"**OpenMV Cam N6** sada je podržan (VID:PID 37C5:1206, DFU pokretač "
"37C5:9206), uključujući postavke firmwarea, Windows DFU upravljački program "
"i Linux udev pravilo (\\ `000ed8a87 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/000ed8a87>`__\\ , `1b950c8c6 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/1b950c8c6>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:290
msgid ""
"**OpenMV Cam RT1062** is now supported under a new custom USB VID/PID "
"(37C5:1060), including DFU drivers, udev rules, and retained legacy "
"1209:ABD1 entries for older units (`f453bc945 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/f453bc945>`__, `d55d6441f <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d55d6441f>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**OpenMV Cam RT1062** sada je podržan pod novim prilagođenim USB VID/PID-om "
"(37C5:1060), uključujući DFU upravljačke programe, udev pravila i zadržane "
"naslijeđene 1209:ABD1 stavke za starije jedinice (\\ `f453bc945 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f453bc945>`__\\ , `d55d6441f "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d55d6441f>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:295
msgid ""
"**OpenMV Cam AE3** is now supported, including Windows DFU drivers, its "
"firmware/config image tree, and USB VID/PID (updated to 37C5:16E3 runtime / "
"37C5:96E3 bootloader) (`4a16e04c2 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/4a16e04c2>`__, `cc52e76f5 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/cc52e76f5>`__, `3f75e7de4 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/3f75e7de4>`__, `8eb80b129 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/8eb80b129>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**OpenMV Cam AE3** sada je podržan, uključujući Windows DFU upravljačke "
"programe, njegovo stablo firmware/config slika i USB VID/PID (ažurirano na "
"37C5:16E3 runtime / 37C5:96E3 pokretač) (\\ `4a16e04c2 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/4a16e04c2>`__\\ , `cc52e76f5 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/cc52e76f5>`__\\ , `3f75e7de4 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3f75e7de4>`__\\ , `8eb80b129 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/8eb80b129>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:302
msgid ""
"**New USB VID/PID system:** OpenMV cameras move to vendor ID ``37C5`` with "
"new bootloader/DFU IDs (e.g. 37C5:1202/9202 M4, 1203/9203 M7, 1204/9204 H7, "
"124A/924A H7 Plus, 1205/9205), relabeling old 1209:ABD1 boards as Legacy "
"while still supporting both old and new firmware (`6d78d6571 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/6d78d6571>`__, `6a6a9351d "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/6a6a9351d>`__, `500b1a0bf "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/500b1a0bf>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Novi USB VID/PID sustav:** OpenMV kamere prelaze na ID proizvođača "
"``37C5`` s novim ID-ovima pokretača/DFU-a (npr. 37C5:1202/9202 M4, 1203/9203"
" M7, 1204/9204 H7, 124A/924A H7 Plus, 1205/9205), preimenujući stare ploče "
"1209:ABD1 u Legacy uz i dalje podržavanje i starog i novog firmwarea (\\ "
"`6d78d6571 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/6d78d6571>`__\\ , "
"`6a6a9351d <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/6a6a9351d>`__\\ , "
"`500b1a0bf <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/500b1a0bf>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:309
msgid ""
"**PAG7936** image sensor added to the recognized sensor list (`f9e3f3461 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f9e3f3461>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**PAG7936** senzor slike dodan je na popis prepoznatih senzora (\\ "
"`f9e3f3461 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/f9e3f3461>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.4.0.rst:311
msgid ""
