"creator/commit/9133b1516>`__\\ ), s nativnim ``libpython3.13`` i ``ujson`` "
"dijeljenim bibliotekama (\\ `d3aa663d8 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d3aa663d8>`__\\ , `a2cb24e74 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a2cb24e74>`__\\ )."

