"creator/commit/5f2e45196>`__, `3b6c6c312 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/3b6c6c312>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Priloženi jezični poslužitelj:** ``pylsp`` s astroid 3.3.5 na Windowsu, "
"macOS-u i Linux x86_64 (\\ `257addee0 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/257addee0>`__\\ ). Windows build isporučuje ugrađeni CPython "
"s python-lsp-server 1.12.0, jedi 0.17.2, docstring_to_markdown 0.15, pip "
"24.2 i distlib 0.3.9 (\\ `9b6434602 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/9b6434602>`__\\ , `069807cd3 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/069807cd3>`__\\ , `5f2e45196 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/5f2e45196>`__\\ , `3b6c6c312 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/3b6c6c312>`__\\ )."

